- [x] Add focused regressions for channel layout, independent source geometry, byte endpoints, full height range, density thresholds, mixed availability, ocean knownness, coverage and stale-source rejection. Use subagents for build/test tools and the canonical build/package workflow; record normal development-launch shader loading; remaining visual/capture verification is waived by the user's completion instruction below. Do not claim a standalone graphics harness, permanent readbacks or unperformed capture checks.
- [x] Reconcile the proposal and permanent architecture documentation with the implemented representation, recording validation limitations separately from measured performance claims.

